# Workspace topic routing

If the user names a **topic slug** (or says “stay on X”), read `cursor_oralable/docs/WORKSPACE_TOPICS.md` and stay in that topic.

- Open only the repos and start-here files listed for that slug unless the user asks to cross topics.
- If they name two slugs, treat the first as the write target.
- Do not invent FW/app version numbers; use `cursor_oralable/docs/data_room/VERSION_ALIGNMENT.md`.
- Mac Python is the algorithm reference. Change the phone to match Mac unless the exceptions registry says otherwise.
